        "text": "Peaka lists 32 MCP tools, including peaka_create_cache, peaka_create_cache_batch, peaka_create_query, peaka_create_semantic_catalog, peaka_create_semantic_table, peaka_delete_cache, peaka_delete_query, peaka_delete_semantic_table, peaka_execute_query, peaka_execute_sql_query, peaka_get_cache_statuses, and peaka_get_connection_detail."
